WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:03.470
<b>I'm disappointed in you, Little Devil.</b>

00:03.470 --> 00:06.750
<b>Even with all those 
illegal abilities I gave you,</b>

00:06.750 --> 00:09.900
<b>you still couldn't take care 
of one pathetic cheater.</b>

00:09.900 --> 00:13.850
<b>Your position, experience, and talent
 are nothing compared to him.</b>

00:14.160 --> 00:16.880
<b>And now, you're holding me back.</b>

00:16.880 --> 00:21.400
<b>You're going to pay me back 
the value of everything I gave you.</b>

00:21.780 --> 00:22.880
<b>Won't you?</b>

00:23.440 --> 00:28.130
<b>Starting today, you're my slave.
 I'll make you do all of my dirty work.</b>

00:30.670 --> 00:33.000
<b>What's your response to that, you brat?!</b>

00:33.460 --> 00:36.220
<b>I'm going to be your slave...</b>

00:38.940 --> 00:41.640
<b>Not. Did you think I'd say that?</b>

00:42.160 --> 00:45.390
<b>Oh, so scary! Just like a real devil.</b>

00:45.390 --> 00:47.390
<b>Shinohara Hiroto!</b>

00:48.070 --> 00:49.660
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

00:52.800 --> 00:55.070
<b>Oh, it isn't just me here.</b>

01:03.030 --> 01:05.260
<b>Come on, smile a little, Kurahashi.</b>

01:05.590 --> 01:09.400
<b>Because hundreds of thousands of
 people are watching you right now.</b>

01:12.000 --> 01:15.010
<b>Seijo Academy Headmaster Scandal</b>

01:12.000 --> 01:15.010
<b>people are watching</b>

01:12.000 --> 01:15.010
<b>Downvote</b>

01:12.000 --> 01:15.010
<b>Share</b>

01:22.300 --> 01:24.810
<b>And that's game over.</b>

01:29.980 --> 01:33.150
<b>All-Campus Elimination Battle
Final Day (Friday)</b>

01:30.460 --> 01:33.160
<b>Good morning, kiddos.</b>

01:33.430 --> 01:36.490
<b>You know, something 
wonderful happened yesterday.</b>

01:33.650 --> 01:38.660
<b>Silence 
and Change</b>

01:37.310 --> 01:41.410
<b>A disgusting dictator finally got
 exposed for the scumbag he is.</b>

01:41.410 --> 01:45.290
<b>Despite his innocent look, 
he was a manipulative con man,</b>

01:45.290 --> 01:47.710
<b>but he was taken down in one night.</b>

01:47.710 --> 01:51.590
<b>I'm super tired after celebrating 
late into the night with some drinks,</b>

01:51.590 --> 01:54.680
<b>but I hope you can overlook that
as a benefit of being an adult.</b>

01:54.960 --> 01:58.810
<b>Now, then. The All-Campus Elimination 
Battle has reached its final stage.</b>

01:58.810 --> 02:01.590
<b>The remaining survivors are these two.</b>

02:01.900 --> 02:05.500
<b>The first is the strongest on 
Academy Island, Shinohara Hiroto.</b>

02:05.500 --> 02:09.970
<b>Well, if a Seven Star <i>didn't</i> last 
this long, he'd be an eternal disgrace.</b>

02:10.510 --> 02:13.220
<b>That's kind of a malicious way to put it.</b>

02:13.220 --> 02:17.410
<b>Next is the Little Devil:
 the Six Star, Akizuki Noa.</b>

02:20.240 --> 02:22.990
<b>They're both confirmed for
 the district elimination team,</b>

02:22.990 --> 02:25.800
<b>but it's time to decide 
who Eimei's ace will be</b>

02:25.800 --> 02:28.860
<b>with a top-level battle.
The Six Star versus the Seven Star.</b>

02:28.860 --> 02:30.290
<b>Brace yourselves for a—</b>

02:29.470 --> 02:30.960
<b>Um, Headmistress?</b>

02:31.630 --> 02:34.820
<b>May I say something? I, um...</b>

02:35.290 --> 02:39.080
<b>I have no intention of fighting Hiroto-kun.</b>

02:40.290 --> 02:42.710
<b>Would you mind explaining why not?</b>

02:42.710 --> 02:45.470
<b>I think most people already 
heard this on the stream,</b>

02:45.470 --> 02:50.250
<b>but nobody ever paid any attention 
to me, so I wanted to be special.</b>

02:50.250 --> 02:54.300
<b>I used illegal methods to try
 to steal Stars from Hiroto.</b>

02:54.300 --> 02:55.930
<b>I'm really very sorry!</b>

02:56.190 --> 02:59.120
<b>Well, it didn't work out that way,</b>

02:59.120 --> 03:01.790
<b>but while everyone devoted
themselves to the event,</b>

03:01.790 --> 03:03.900
<b>I alone was plotting evil schemes.</b>

03:03.900 --> 03:06.590
<b>So I wish to withdraw from 
the All-Campus Elimination—</b>

03:06.590 --> 03:07.910
<b>Stop right there, Akizuki.</b>

03:07.910 --> 03:10.290
<b>Wh-What's wrong, Hiroto-kun?</b>

03:10.290 --> 03:12.990
<b>There's absolutely no reason 
for you to withdraw.</b>

03:12.990 --> 03:13.490
<b>Huh?</b>

03:13.970 --> 03:16.210
<b>It was all that jerk Kurahashi's fault.</b>

03:16.210 --> 03:18.210
<b>And I didn't lose anything in the end.</b>

03:18.210 --> 03:21.650
<b>B-But nobody's going to forgive me!</b>

03:21.650 --> 03:24.720
<b>Is that what you think? 
Then, take a look at this.</b>

03:24.720 --> 03:26.060
<b>Should Akizuki Noa</b>

03:24.720 --> 03:26.060
<b>Should Akizuki Noa</b>

03:24.720 --> 03:26.060
<b>be forgiven?</b>

03:24.720 --> 03:26.060
<b>be forgiven?</b>

03:26.060 --> 03:27.720
<b>Survey</b>

03:26.060 --> 03:27.720
<b>Forgive</b>

03:26.060 --> 03:27.720
<b>Don't Forgive</b>

03:26.380 --> 03:27.730
<b>What is this?</b>

03:28.180 --> 03:32.860
<b>It's a survey of Eimei students
 Libra carried out right after the stream.</b>

03:33.280 --> 03:39.410
<b>And you can see the results. 
A good 99.5% are on your side.</b>

03:39.410 --> 03:42.870
<b>Basically, the consensus at 
Eimei is that it wasn't your fault.</b>

03:43.200 --> 03:43.870
<b>Huh?</b>

03:43.870 --> 03:47.400
<b>Jeez. And you think people 
don't pay attention to you?</b>

03:47.400 --> 03:50.090
<b>Even our Empress was singing your praises.</b>

03:50.090 --> 03:51.500
<b>N-No way...</b>

03:52.050 --> 03:55.860
<b>Listen, Akizuki. You just 
got a little carried away.</b>

03:56.460 --> 04:00.880
<b>In reality, you'd already become 
someone special by your efforts alone.</b>

04:01.800 --> 04:05.140
<b>And so, I want to make a suggestion.</b>

04:05.140 --> 04:10.010
<b>The winner of the Elimination Battle 
and Eimei's ace is you, Akizuki.</b>

04:10.740 --> 04:11.760
<b>Huh?</b>

04:11.760 --> 04:14.530
<b>I'm saying I'm the one who's gonna withdraw.</b>

04:14.530 --> 04:16.500
<b>Huh? B-But why?</b>

04:16.500 --> 04:20.020
<b>Look, I'm already the strongest 
on Academy Island, right?</b>

04:20.550 --> 04:22.030
<b>B-But still...</b>

04:22.030 --> 04:26.400
<b>Anyway, it's too late now. 
I just sent the formal withdrawal request.</b>

04:26.400 --> 04:30.150
<b>Too bad for you guys who were 
betting on me to take first place.</b>

04:30.150 --> 04:31.720
<b>What? Can he do that?</b>

04:30.920 --> 04:32.490
<b>The Little Devil got first?</b>

04:32.490 --> 04:33.750
<b>The Seven Star forfeited?</b>

04:33.090 --> 04:33.750
<b>See?</b>

04:34.300 --> 04:36.960
<b>Now you truly are someone special.</b>

04:38.850 --> 04:42.990
<b>All right. In that case, I'll be Eimei's ace.</b>

04:43.490 --> 04:48.270
<b>I'll become the perfect ace. One that 
can face you head-on and not lose.</b>

04:48.590 --> 04:51.890
<b>And I want you all to 
support me all the way!</b>

04:54.500 --> 04:56.170
<b><i>That Shinohara...</i></b>

04:57.150 --> 05:00.940
<b><i>I have a feeling he's gonna make 
this year's Inter-Academy Battle fun.</i></b>

05:01.620 --> 05:02.930
<b>All righty, then.</b>

05:02.440 --> 05:03.440
<b>The May Inter-Academy Battle</b>

05:02.440 --> 05:03.440
<b>Chosen Members</b>

05:03.770 --> 05:07.460
<b>The flawless high-spec maid, 
Himeji Shirayuki!</b>

05:04.030 --> 05:07.450
<b>Himeji Shirayuki</b>

05:07.800 --> 05:11.470
<b><i>Nice job, Himeji! You got yourself 
back up to Four Stars in just one day!</i></b>

05:11.470 --> 05:14.940
<b><i>One of Eimei's trio of Six Stars,
 the Golden Demon,</i></b>

05:15.040 --> 05:16.710
<b>Asamiya Nanase</b>

05:15.250 --> 05:16.710
<b>Asamiya Nanase!</b>

05:16.710 --> 05:20.080
<b>Ditto, the Six Star student 
council president with second sight,</b>

05:20.130 --> 05:21.710
<b>Enomoto Shinji</b>

05:20.360 --> 05:21.720
<b>Enomoto Shinji!</b>

05:22.130 --> 05:24.720
<b>No introduction needed for 
the Academy Island's strongest,</b>

05:24.720 --> 05:27.080
<b>the Seven Star, Shinohara Hiroto!</b>

05:24.760 --> 05:27.090
<b>Shinohara Hiroto</b>

05:27.080 --> 05:31.480
<b>And finally, Eimei's new ace,
 the Six Star Little Devil,</b>

05:30.640 --> 05:32.220
<b>Akizuki Noa</b>

05:31.480 --> 05:33.000
<b>Akizuki Noa!</b>

05:33.000 --> 05:37.220
<b>These are the five who will represent us
 in the May Inter-Academy Battle!</b>

05:37.700 --> 05:39.140
<b>Don't let us down!</b>

05:38.610 --> 05:40.740
<b>Give us a good show!</b>

05:39.140 --> 05:40.740
<b>We're looking forward to it!</b>

05:41.290 --> 05:43.470
<b>So I guess it turned out okay.</b>

05:43.470 --> 05:47.990
<b>No kidding. I'm glad the 
Little Devil didn't get kicked out.</b>

05:47.990 --> 05:51.740
<b>But, as an Ouka student, 
I can't be seen to be too happy about it.</b>

05:52.740 --> 05:55.970
<b>Still, she wasn't let off 
without <i>any</i> penalties.</b>

05:55.970 --> 05:59.370
<b>As a reward for winning, 
I got her to give me the Green Star.</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:04.410
<b>So, right now, you're actually
a triple-colored Three Star?</b>

06:04.410 --> 06:05.640
<b>Yup, exactly.</b>

06:06.090 --> 06:08.810
<b><i>I'm still a ways away 
from being a real Seven Star,</i></b>

06:08.810 --> 06:12.130
<b><i>but if I can keep raising my rank
like this, I'll see her someday.</i></b>

06:12.140 --> 06:14.100
<b>Ability Shop</b>

06:12.440 --> 06:16.270
<b>So, we finally got a day off, and you 
wanted to meet, but where are we going?</b>

06:14.100 --> 06:15.470
<b>Ability Shop</b>

06:15.470 --> 06:16.600
<b>Ability Shop</b>

06:16.600 --> 06:17.430
<b>Ability Shop</b>

06:17.430 --> 06:19.270
<b>Ability Shop</b>

06:18.270 --> 06:19.260
<b>Right here.</b>

06:19.260 --> 06:20.180
<b>Huh?</b>

06:20.770 --> 06:26.030
<b>Ability Shop</b>

06:20.770 --> 06:26.030
<b>Entry Restricted to Couples Only</b>

06:21.320 --> 06:23.000
<b>What's this all about, Saionji?</b>

06:23.000 --> 06:26.020
<b>I-It isn't about anything.
 It's exactly what it looks like.</b>

06:26.300 --> 06:31.150
<b>This shop sells some great stuff. You used 
a card from here against the Little Devil.</b>

06:31.740 --> 06:35.310
<b>Oh, I see. So this is where 
you got that Pinch Hitter, huh?</b>

06:35.310 --> 06:40.050
<b>That's right. But you have to 
follow one weird rule to get in.</b>

06:40.040 --> 06:42.040
<b>Couples Only</b>

06:40.050 --> 06:42.030
<b>Yeah, but <i>this</i>?</b>

06:42.490 --> 06:46.540
<b>I-I told you, right? That I can't get in alone,
 and I needed you to come with me.</b>

06:46.540 --> 06:48.810
<b>Honestly, you should be honored.</b>

06:48.810 --> 06:53.800
<b>Even if it's temporary,
 you get to be my l-lover for a bit.</b>

06:55.180 --> 06:56.810
<b>Whoa.</b>

06:57.320 --> 07:00.800
<b>I did tell her I'd be coming today.</b>

07:01.300 --> 07:03.180
<b>Excuse me?</b>

07:03.450 --> 07:05.860
<b>Come on in! Wait, huh?</b>

07:05.860 --> 07:07.070
<b>Lily-chan?</b>

07:07.530 --> 07:11.570
<b><i>"Lily"? Oh, right. She can't use 
either of her other names.</i></b>

07:08.100 --> 07:11.070
<b>Oh, yeah. You did message me.</b>

07:11.810 --> 07:15.330
<b>Hey, Lily-chan. You know my policy, right?</b>

07:15.330 --> 07:18.580
<b>I only sell to people I like.</b>

07:18.580 --> 07:20.460
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

07:20.460 --> 07:24.490
<b>And I decide who I like by 
whether or not they follow the rules.</b>

07:24.490 --> 07:27.100
<b>So I guess that means 
this is your boyfriend?</b>

07:27.940 --> 07:30.170
<b>Th-That's right. Shino...</b>

07:30.170 --> 07:32.830
<b>His name is Hiro. I-Isn't he cool?</b>

07:33.140 --> 07:35.840
<b>I'm just tagging along, so don't mind me.</b>

07:35.840 --> 07:40.680
<b>Oh, you wish! Lily-chan hasn't 
had any luck with boys before,</b>

07:40.680 --> 07:44.180
<b>and now she comes to show 
her boyfriend off to me?</b>

07:44.180 --> 07:49.790
<b>I get it. Hiro-kun must be a wild stud.
 I might just die of jealousy.</b>

07:50.190 --> 07:55.730
<b>Though, I'm not actually jealous.
Are you two really going out?</b>

07:55.960 --> 07:56.610
<b>Huh?</b>

07:56.610 --> 07:59.490
<b>I mean, you should at least 
be holding hands or something.</b>

07:59.490 --> 08:00.800
<b>B-But...</b>

08:00.800 --> 08:03.990
<b>It's not like I'm telling you
to kiss on the spot.</b>

08:03.990 --> 08:07.370
<b>Ki... H-How could I do that 
with someone watching, dummy?</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:08.920
<b>Hey, Lily!</b>

08:08.920 --> 08:10.070
<b>Psst, Saionji.</b>

08:10.070 --> 08:10.750
<b>Eep.</b>

08:10.750 --> 08:14.760
<b>Wh-What now, stupid Shinohara? 
Are you gonna start teasing me, too?</b>

08:14.760 --> 08:20.690
<b>No, not that. We just have to hold hands, 
right? If so, let's just get it over with.</b>

08:20.690 --> 08:24.400
<b>A-Are you saying you want to 
put your hands on me?</b>

08:24.400 --> 08:25.530
<b>Don't start that!</b>

08:26.180 --> 08:29.000
<b>You're embarrassed 
because you're overthinking it.</b>

08:32.510 --> 08:33.870
<b>Uh, Lily?</b>

08:35.280 --> 08:37.000
<b>This is just a handshake.</b>

08:37.320 --> 08:41.670
<b>Huh? No, it isn't! 
Um, uh, it isn't! I said it isn't!</b>

08:42.960 --> 08:44.870
<b>Yeah, yeah, like that!</b>

08:45.540 --> 08:49.760
<b>But I mean, the atmosphere got 
so stuffy, I had to stop watching.</b>

08:49.760 --> 08:52.160
<b>I'll recognize you two as lovers.</b>

08:52.160 --> 08:53.530
<b>R-Really?</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:57.830
<b>Is that really okay? 
All we did was shake hands.</b>

08:57.830 --> 08:59.190
<b>Hey, Hiro!</b>

09:00.450 --> 09:06.600
<b>Of course. I've always liked Lily-chan, and 
you're growing on me, so it's fine. You pass.</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Ability Card</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Display Bug</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Nullify Interference</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Inability Barrier</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Force Stop</b>

09:05.560 --> 09:10.570
<b>Force Stop</b>

09:06.610 --> 09:10.030
<b>All right. I'll sell you any ability you want.</b>

09:10.750 --> 09:14.080
<b>I was surprised to see so many 
rare abilities in one place.</b>

09:14.080 --> 09:17.930
<b>O-Oh, come on. You really 
don't know anything, do you?</b>

09:17.930 --> 09:22.070
<b>I hope you're grateful 
that I took you to that shop.</b>

09:22.410 --> 09:25.590
<b>Welcome home, Master and Rina.</b>

09:25.590 --> 09:27.220
<b>Oh, hey. We're back.</b>

09:27.220 --> 09:29.090
<b>Did you have an enjoyable date?</b>

09:29.090 --> 09:33.360
<b>D-Date? I-It wasn't! I just asked 
him to come shopping with me.</b>

09:33.360 --> 09:36.700
<b>But you <i>did</i> go to a shop 
that only admits couples.</b>

09:36.700 --> 09:38.730
<b>H-How did you know that?</b>

09:39.290 --> 09:41.720
<b><i>Th-That's a high-spec maid for you.</i></b>

09:42.300 --> 09:47.010
<b>Master and Rina, you helped me greatly
 during the All-Campus Elimination Battle.</b>

09:47.010 --> 09:50.090
<b>As such, I wish to treat you 
with the utmost in service today.</b>

09:50.090 --> 09:53.240
<b>Oh, uh, but you're always 
the one taking care of us.</b>

09:53.240 --> 09:55.310
<b>You don't need to worry about us so much.</b>

09:55.310 --> 09:59.000
<b>Though I'd really love one of 
your home-cooked meals again.</b>

10:00.110 --> 10:01.420
<b>What do you think?</b>

10:01.420 --> 10:05.860
<b>Dinner is all ready, but would you 
like to take a relaxing bath first?</b>

10:05.860 --> 10:10.370
<b>Yeah, that might be an idea. We're probably 
all sweaty from how much we walked today.</b>

10:10.370 --> 10:13.010
<b>I guess I'll take her up on that.</b>

10:13.010 --> 10:17.630
<b>Well, then, I would be happy to scrub 
both of your backs at the same time.</b>

10:18.240 --> 10:19.880
<b>Th-The same time?</b>

10:19.880 --> 10:22.420
<b>Whoa, hold up, hold up. The same time?</b>

10:22.420 --> 10:24.150
<b>Wouldn't he see me naked?</b>

10:24.150 --> 10:25.880
<b>You will wear swimsuits, naturally.</b>

10:25.880 --> 10:27.430
<b>I know that you wear bikinis</b>

10:27.430 --> 10:31.100
<b>and show skin to countless male 
strangers on the beach during the summer,</b>

10:31.100 --> 10:32.650
<b>so I doubt it will be a problem.</b>

10:32.650 --> 10:35.500
<b>I get a feeling that was meant to be a jibe.</b>

10:35.500 --> 10:40.030
<b>Plus, this mansion is equipped with a special 
extra-large bath for use by the Seven Star.</b>

10:40.030 --> 10:45.030
<b>Y-Yeah, but wearing a bathing suit 
in the bath sounds even kinkier.</b>

10:45.870 --> 10:50.290
<b>In that case, would you prefer to be nude? 
I am prepared for that, if it is necessary.</b>

10:50.290 --> 10:52.660
<b>Th-That's not what I meant! Jeez.</b>

10:53.080 --> 10:56.910
<b>Wait a minute. Are you annoyed 
that we went shopping without you?</b>

10:56.910 --> 10:58.160
<b>Surely not.</b>

10:58.380 --> 11:01.860
<b>Himeji always gets real 
stubborn about stuff like this.</b>

11:01.860 --> 11:04.920
<b>B-But I didn't bring a swimsuit.</b>

11:09.300 --> 11:11.380
<b>Fine. You win, Yuki.</b>

11:12.510 --> 11:15.870
<b>Very well. Let us all take a bath together.</b>

11:21.740 --> 11:23.450
<b>This is heaven.</b>

11:25.590 --> 11:27.620
<b>Wait! Don't look yet!</b>

11:28.200 --> 11:29.240
<b>Uh, right.</b>

11:29.240 --> 11:33.250
<b>My apologies, Master. Please wait a moment.</b>

11:37.770 --> 11:42.500
<b><i>Wh-What's happening to me? 
All I can hear is the shower behind me,</i></b>

11:42.500 --> 11:45.550
<b><i>and all I can see is the 
painting of Mt. Fuji on the wall,</i></b>

11:45.550 --> 11:47.770
<b><i>but my heart's totally racing!</i></b>

11:49.210 --> 11:51.390
<b>Well, then. Please excuse us.</b>

11:51.390 --> 11:52.890
<b>How's the temperature?</b>

11:52.890 --> 11:54.550
<b>Yeah, the water's fine—</b>

12:03.410 --> 12:06.990
<b>Come on, don't just sit there.
 Say something.</b>

12:06.990 --> 12:08.190
<b>I-It looks good on you.</b>

12:08.810 --> 12:12.110
<b>Rina, you are flirting with Master too much.</b>

12:12.110 --> 12:13.320
<b>That is not fair.</b>

12:14.000 --> 12:17.710
<b><i>On this day, a super-elite VIP, 
my personal maid, and I...</i></b>

12:18.070 --> 12:20.220
