 and my lies will be exposed.</i></b>

20:27.210 --> 20:28.570
<b>Hey, Enomoto.</b>

20:28.570 --> 20:31.830
<b>You left out the crucial "senpai." 
What is it, Shinohara?</b>

20:32.220 --> 20:35.260
<b>Commander can trade places 
with someone once in the game.</b>

20:35.260 --> 20:38.020
<b>So let me take it at first.</b>

20:38.020 --> 20:43.600
<b>And if I don't meet with your approval, 
I'll find the right moment to give it to you.</b>

20:44.870 --> 20:48.090
<b>In that case, I'd say 
I should take it first, but...</b>

20:48.570 --> 20:54.060
<b>Okay, on one condition. Take out three 
other commanders by the end of the third day.</b>

20:54.060 --> 20:57.120
<b>If you don't manage it, 
you will give me the commander role.</b>

20:57.120 --> 21:01.600
<b>Please wait, Enomoto-sama. Do you not 
think that condition is somewhat unfair?</b>

21:02.040 --> 21:06.100
<b>What if you choose to refuse 
to cooperate with him?</b>

21:06.100 --> 21:08.690
<b>Himeji Shirayuki-kun, is it?</b>

21:08.690 --> 21:12.230
<b>Your attitude is excellent, 
but I think you are overlooking something.</b>

21:12.720 --> 21:14.620
<b>Overlooking?</b>

21:14.620 --> 21:20.120
<b>That's right. As Eimei Academy's student 
council president, I simply want to win.</b>

21:20.490 --> 21:25.750
<b>In the yearly academy rankings, 
Eimei has been stuck at #5 for several years.</b>

21:25.750 --> 21:28.260
<b>I want to raise that rank.</b>

21:28.530 --> 21:32.520
<b>With Seven Star Shinohara here, 
we have a good chance of doing that this year.</b>

21:32.520 --> 21:35.510
<b>As such, I would do
absolutely nothing to hinder him.</b>

21:35.740 --> 21:37.640
<b>Okay. Good enough for me.</b>

21:37.990 --> 21:41.830
<b>If I can't pull it off, I'll give
the commander's role to you,</b>

21:42.730 --> 21:45.530
<b>and I'll even talk to you 
politely for the rest of my life.</b>

21:48.500 --> 21:49.430
<b>Hello?</b>

21:49.430 --> 21:50.580
<b><i>Shinohara?</i></b>

21:50.580 --> 21:53.730
<b><i>Oh, good. If you hadn't answered, 
I don't know what I would've done.</i></b>

21:52.940 --> 21:54.750
<b>What's happened? Why are you so upset?</b>

21:54.750 --> 21:57.500
<b><i>Because we're in serious trouble!</i></b>

21:57.830 --> 21:59.790
<b>Trouble? What do you mean?</b>

21:59.790 --> 22:03.060
<b><i>It's Sarasa! Another one 
who isn't me or the real thing.</i></b>

22:03.330 --> 22:06.470
<b>A <i>third</i> Saionji Sarasa has appeared!</b>

22:07.170 --> 22:08.070
<b>Huh?</b>
